{"id":"rue-part3-0056","taskId":"rue-part3","title":"Drill set 56","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"modernise","accept":["modernize"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The company needs to ___ (MODERN) its factories.","hint":"verb: make modern","explanation":"\u0027Modernise\u0027 (BrE) / \u0027modernize\u0027 \u2014 verb with -ise."},{"answer":"critical","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The report was highly ___ (CRITIC) of the new scheme.","hint":"adjective: finding fault","explanation":"\u0027Highly critical of\u0027 \u2014 the adjective describing a judgement."},{"answer":"education","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The programme aims at the ___ (EDUCATE) of young farmers.","hint":"noun after the","explanation":"\u0027The education of\u0027 \u2014 the noun."},{"answer":"simply","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The problem was ___ (SIMPLE) a matter of bad timing.","hint":"adverb: merely","explanation":"\u0027Simply a matter of\u0027 = only a matter of."},{"answer":"discovery","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The ___ (DISCOVER) of penicillin changed medicine.","hint":"noun: act of finding","explanation":"\u0027The discovery of\u2026\u0027 \u2014 noun from discover (y-ending)."},{"answer":"recovery","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The economy shows signs of ___ (RECOVER) after the recession.","hint":"noun: getting better","explanation":"The noun from RECOVER is \u0027recovery\u0027."},{"answer":"bravery","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He was praised for his ___ (BRAVE) during the fire.","hint":"noun after possessive","explanation":"\u0027His bravery\u0027 \u2014 quality noun; \u0027braveness\u0027 exists but is rare; \u0027bravery\u0027 is standard."},{"answer":"un